                <!-- The dock: fixed at the bottom-center of the beach area
                     (BeachArea-local coordinates, same space roamX/roamY
                     use, so a full producer can walk straight to it with
                     no coordinate conversion). Dimmed until dockSpeed is
                     first purchased, at full opacity once robots can
                     actually use it. Declared last so robots and tracks
                     both draw in front of it. -->
