                <!-- One slot, two identities: before the first purchase it
                     reads "Auto-Sell" (buying it unlocks docking at all);
                     from then on the same panel becomes the repeatable
                     "Robot Speed" upgrade for the dock-seeking trip. Both
                     states are the same dockSpeed stat (0 = locked), so
                     the label is a single computed string rather than two
                     panels swapped by visibility. -->
